The following projects inspired or are used by k0d3ball35. None of their files are redistributed
in this repository unless stated.

Owner wordmark
  spec/images/logo.png and everything generated from it (spec/images/logo.svg,
  hardware/case/logo_data.scad, the engraving on the case) is the project owner's mark. It is not covered by the MIT or
  CERN-OHL-P licences of this repository: a fork may keep the design files but has to replace
  the artwork with its own (set logo_on_cap and logo_on_floor to false, or drop in another
  logo.png and re-run scripts/gen_logo.py).

Keyball (Yowkees)
  https://github.com/Yowkees/keyball - GPL-3.0 (repository), GPL-2.0-or-later (firmware)
  Inspiration for the hand geometry and the build guide structure. The column stagger ratios and
  thumb arc angles were measured from the published gerber files and re-expressed as parameters.
  No design files, footprints, symbols, copper or firmware code from Keyball are included.
  "Keyball" is the name of Yowkees' product line; k0d3ball35 is an independent design.

torabo-tsuki-lp (sekigon-gonnoc)
  https://github.com/sekigon-gonnoc/torabo-tsuki-lp - MIT
  Reference for low-profile 25 mm trackball mechanics and FPC-connected sensor modules.

kiswitch (formerly perigoso/keyswitch-kicad-library)
  https://github.com/kiswitch/kiswitch - MIT (scripts), CC-BY-SA 4.0 (library data)
  Kailh Choc V1 switch and hot-swap socket footprints, included in hardware/lib.

KiCad footprint library
  https://gitlab.com/kicad/libraries/kicad-footprints - CC-BY-SA 4.0 with the KiCad library
  exception (a design using a footprint is not a derivative work)
  SW_SPDT_Shouhan_MSK12C02 was the reference for the MSK-12C02 slide switch pad geometry in
  scripts/k0d3/footprints.py, which upstream in turn took from the SHOU-HAN MSK12C02 datasheet
  (LCSC C431540). The footprint is regenerated from those numbers here, no file is copied.

marbastlib (ebastler, MarvFPV)
  https://github.com/ebastler/marbastlib - CERN-OHL-P-2.0
  Controller, connector and battery footprints, included in hardware/lib.

pmw3610-pcb (bullwinkle3000)
  https://github.com/bullwinkle3000/pmw3610-pcb - CERN-OHL-P-2.0
  Reference circuit for the PMW3610 sensor board.

ZMK Firmware
  https://github.com/zmkfirmware/zmk - MIT
  Firmware framework used by firmware/zmk-config.

Zephyr Project
  https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr - Apache-2.0
  RTOS underlying ZMK, provides the pixart,pmw3610 input driver.

roBa (kumamuk-git)
  https://github.com/kumamuk-git/roBa - GPL-3.0
  Studied for its PMW3610 breakout and power design. No files included.

Kivipallur (dr3san)
  https://github.com/dr3san/Kivipallur - GPL-3.0
  Studied for its 25 mm ball and ceramic bearing choices. No files included.

PixArt PMW3610DM-SUDU datasheet
  https://www.pixart.com/products-detail/21/PMW3610DM-SUDU
  Electrical and optical parameters of the sensor.
